# msim-trace 1
# limits 2,10,1000
#
# The order index is full (2 orders). A buy that crosses order 1 and has 3
# left over can still rest: executing order 1 in full frees its slot first.
# A buy that crosses nothing has no slot to take and is refused.
1 add 1 S 100 5
2 add 2 B 90 1
3 add 3 B 95 1
4 add 4 B 100 8
5 add 5 S 100 1
